#  如果以后你在 Keil 的 RTE 里启用了 CMSIS-DSP，再把对应行注释掉。
# ============================================================
Drivers/CMSIS/Lib/
Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/
Drivers/CMSIS/NN/
Drivers/CMSIS/Core_A/
Drivers/CMSIS/RTOS/
Drivers/CMSIS/RTOS2/
Drivers/CMSIS/docs/
